{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21930","headline":"李都尉古劒 · 白居易","name":"李都尉古劒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古劒寒黯黯，铸来几千秋。\n白光纳日月，紫气排斗牛。\n有客借一观，爱之不敢求。\n湛然玉匣中，秋水澄不流。\n至宝有本性，精刚无与俦。\n可使寸寸折，不能绕指柔。\n愿快直士心，将断佞臣头。\n不愿报小怨，夜半刺私雠。\n劝君慎所用，无作神兵羞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21930.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21930","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}